## What to deliver

Build the nest sprite up operation by operation until the image in `canvas.png`
matches the brief — a centered, roughly symmetric domed mound drawn in neutral
grey, built up in concentric rings with a clear dark entrance hole and a bright
accent ring at its center. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded
`actions.json` is your finished submission.
